{"unit_id":"hakulat2023__dsh-spotlight#card-zh","repo":"hakulat2023/dsh-spotlight","commit":"c0557305c581eec6b17ee9019d22359899cedaeb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-spotlight 是面向 DSH Web 与桌面客户端的快捷命令面板。它把搜索面板注册到客户端覆盖层，可用 Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+P 或斜杠键打开，并支持按中英文关键词筛选命令。面板提供设置、插件、会话搜索、新建与归档会话、工作区文件、侧栏和主题语言切换等操作，也会镜像部分快捷键。其他客户端插件可通过 spotlight 服务注册命令，适合希望从键盘快速访问 DSH 常用操作的用户；使用前需将它加入 DSH profile 的 bundles。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:801-845","client.js:662-745"]}
{"unit_id":"hakulat2023__dsh-spotlight#card-en","repo":"hakulat2023/dsh-spotlight","commit":"c0557305c581eec6b17ee9019d22359899cedaeb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-spotlight is a searchable keyboard command palette for DSH Web and desktop. Open it with Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+P or slash to find actions for settings, plugins, sessions, workspace files, sidebars, themes, and language. Other client plugins can register commands through its spotlight service.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:801-845","client.js:662-745"]}
